WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Open Transit RT. Browser-first local evaluation for small agencies. Local demo only. Not evidence. Not a compliance claim.

00:06.000 --> 00:14.000
First, a technical helper starts the app. The local startup prints a setup URL, so staff do not need tokens, curl, DevTools, or header extensions.

00:14.000 --> 00:22.000
Second, staff sign in locally. They open /admin/local-login, choose Start setup, and receive a short local admin session.

00:22.000 --> 00:30.000
Third, start with actions. Use Start setup, Import GTFS, Check feeds, Connect vehicles, Review readiness, and Get help.

00:30.000 --> 00:38.000
Fourth, check feeds and readiness. Review feeds.json, GTFS, Vehicle Positions, Trip Updates, and Alerts. Readiness is local review, not compliance.

00:38.000 --> 00:48.000
Fifth, know what needs help. Use Maintenance and Help for startup, validators, secrets, and deployment work. No production, consumer, vendor, SLA, or ETA claim is made.
